Package: phassurv
Title: Shared Tools for Zoonoses Surveillance (Demo)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Demo", "Analyst", email = "analyst@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Internal helper functions for the zoonoses and antibiotic
    resistance surveillance demo: data access, outbreak detection with the
    Farrington method, genomic cluster summaries and a shared plot theme.
    Made for a Posit demo with synthetic data.
