    arrow,
    DBI,
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    rlang,
    surveillance,
    tibble
Suggests:
    RPostgres,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
